diagnostic_evidence.quote:
According to Lemma \ref{lem5}, since the sample covariance satisfies $\cov\left(\xi_{\tau^{(k-1)}},\|x^{(k)}-x_{\star}\|\right)\geq0$, then
\begin{eqnarray}
	\label{thm4Eq5}
 	\frac{1}{\ell}\sum_{j=1}^{\ell}\xi_{\tau^{(k-1,j)}}\|x^{(k,j)}-x_{\star}\|_2^2 \geq \left(\frac{1}{\ell}\sum_{j=1}^{\ell}\xi_{\tau^{(k-1,j)}}\right)\left(\frac{1}{\ell}\sum_{j=1}^{\ell}\|x^{(k,j)}-x_{\star}\|_2^2\right).
\end{eqnarray}
